# Ticketing Application

A lightweight and flexible ticket management system designed to streamline maintenance request submission, assignment, communication, tracking, and reporting for organisations. The application provides a centralised platform for managing maintenance and support requests while supporting role-based access control, organisational structures, worker qualifications, reporting, notifications, and email integration.

