# Project Overview

The Ticketing Application provides organisations with a centralised system for managing maintenance and support requests. Users can submit and track tickets, workers can manage assigned tasks, and administrators can oversee organisational operations through reporting and management tools.

The system supports:

- User authentication and role management
- Organisation, team, and site management
- Ticket creation and tracking
- Ticket assignment and workflow management
- Skills and qualifications management
- Communication history
- File attachments
- Email integration
- Notifications
- Reporting and analytics
- Administrative management

---

# Features

## User Management

- User authentication
- Profile management
- Role-based access control
- User status management

## Organisation Management

- Organisation creation and management
- Team management
