## Ticket Management

- Create tickets
- Update ticket status
- Assign tickets
- Close tickets
- Track ticket progress
- View ticket history

## Communication

- Ticket comments
- Communication history
- Email integration

## Reporting

- Team reports
- Member reports
- Organisation reports
- Performance metrics
- Workload analysis

## Notification System

- Assignment notifications
- Ticket updates
- Email notifications

